ANSWERS IN A WAY FORWARD. >> LAST YEAR AROUND CHRISTMAS

00:27:41.221 --> 00:27:44.958
MULTIPLE TENANTS AT THOMAS PAINE SQUARE REPORTED THAT

00:27:44.958 --> 00:27:47.894
PEOPLE THAT THEY HAD IDENTIFIED AS MANAGEMENT STAFF ACCESS

00:27:47.894 --> 00:27:51.765
THEIR UNITS AND ALLEGEDLY REMOVED GIFTS AND OTHER

00:27:51.765 --> 00:27:52.833
PROPERTIES. DOORBELL CAMERA FOOTAGE CAUGHT

00:27:52.833 --> 00:27:56.436
THE INCIDENTS LIVE. BUT THIS GOES BACK EVEN

00:27:56.436 --> 00:28:00.174
FURTHER. IN FACT, ON THE VERY FIRST DAY

00:28:00.174 --> 00:28:01.575
I WAS SWORN INTO OFFICE WE BEGAN RECEIVING DAILY PHONE

00:28:01.575 --> 00:28:04.511
CALLS FROM A DISABLED AND SENIOR RESIDENT WHO WAS

00:28:04.511 --> 00:28:07.781
EFFECTIVELY TRAPPED ON THE SECOND FLOOR AT THOMAS PAINE.

00:28:07.781 --> 00:28:11.318
THAT SAME WEEK TWO MORE SENIORS REPORTED REPEATED DELAYS

00:28:11.318 --> 00:28:14.655
IN ADDRESSING ACCESSIBILITY RELATED MAINTENANCE REQUESTS.

00:28:14.655 --> 00:28:18.191
IT BECAME CLEAR THAT FIRST WEEK THAT THE RESIDENTS AT THOMAS

00:28:18.191 --> 00:28:21.128
PAINE HAVE BEEN IGNORED FOR YEARS.

00:28:21.128 --> 00:28:22.662
WE ALSO CONTINUE TO HEAR FROM RESIDENTS AT THE BOARD WHEN

00:28:22.662 --> 00:28:25.866
RESIDENTS CAME TO PUBLIC COMMENT LAST YEAR.

00:28:25.866 --> 00:28:29.203
THIS INCLUDES RESIDENTS CLAIMING FALSE EVICTION NOTICES

00:28:29.203 --> 00:28:30.603
,NOT ACCEPTING RENT PAYMENT AND A LONG LIST OF BUILDING

00:28:30.603 --> 00:28:36.300
SAFETY ISSUES INCLUDING MOLD AND ASBESTOS ISSUES AS WELL.

00:28:36.543 --> 00:28:37.945
>> RESIDENT COUNCIL LEADERSHIP THAT WE HAVE MET WITH ALSO

00:28:37.945 --> 00:28:40.945
REPORTED HARASSMENT FROM BUILDING MANAGEMENT

00:28:41.214 --> 00:28:44.684
AND SECURITY AND NOTED THAT SECURITY GUARDS HAVE NOT DONE

00:28:44.684 --> 00:28:46.153
ENOUGH TO KEEP RESIDENTS SAFE ESPECIALLY AS A RESIDENT WAS

00:28:46.153 --> 00:28:48.955
BEATEN WITH A HAMMER EARLIER THIS YEAR.

00:28:48.955 --> 00:28:52.359
>> OUR OFFICE HEARD FIRSTHAND ABOUT THE UNSECURED ENTRANCES

00:28:52.359 --> 00:28:56.964
INADEQUATE SECURITY STAFFING AND DELAYED RESPONSES TO SAFETY

00:28:56.964 --> 00:29:00.434
INCIDENTS THAT LEFT MANY FEELING UNSAFE EVEN IN THEIR

00:29:00.434 --> 00:29:03.970
OWN HOMES. >> RESIDENTS HAVE ALSO REPORTED

00:29:03.970 --> 00:29:05.172
LONG STANDING ISSUES WITH DOMA'S HANDLING OF THE

00:29:05.172 --> 00:29:08.442
RECERTIFICATION PROCESS WHICH IS NECESSARY FOR KEEPING THOSE

00:29:08.442 --> 00:29:11.645
AND AFFORDABLE HOUSING VOUCHERS IN THEIR HOMES.

00:29:11.645 --> 00:29:15.782
>> THIS HAS BEEN A PROBLEM AT BOTH THOMAS PAINE AND AT MLK

00:29:15.782 --> 00:29:19.382
MARCUS GARVEY CO-OP. >> DESPITE THESE ALLEGED

00:29:19.719 --> 00:29:23.570
ISSUES, DOMAS AND THE MARCUS GARVEY BOARD HAVE MOVED FORWARD

00:29:23.570 --> 00:29:26.180
WITH EVICTION PROCEEDINGS FOR OVER A DOZEN CO-OP RESIDENTS.

00:29:26.180 --> 00:29:27.681
MANY OF WHOM HAVE LIVED THERE FOR DECADES.

00:29:27.681 --> 00:29:31.618
>> TENANT RIGHTS GROUPS WE ARE COLLABORATING WITH HAVE NOTED

00:29:31.618 --> 00:29:34.888
HOW UNUSUALLY FAST AND AGGRESSIVE THIS EVICTION

00:29:34.888 --> 00:29:38.892
PROCESS HAS BEEN. MLK MARCUS GARVEY HAS ALSO BEEN

00:29:38.892 --> 00:29:41.962
THE SITE OF SEVERAL DB COMPLAINTS ABOUT ROOFS CAVING

00:29:41.962 --> 00:29:43.430
IN MOLD AND OTHER SERIOUS WATER AND SEWER ISSUES THAT IMPACT

00:29:43.430 --> 00:29:47.233
THE LIVABILITY OF THE UNITS AT THE CO-OP ESPECIALLY FOR THE

00:29:47.233 --> 00:29:50.637
MANY SENIORS THAT CALL THE COMPLEX HOME.

00:29:50.637 --> 00:29:54.107
IN ADDITION TO DOMAS WE WILL BE ALSO INVITING LEADERSHIP FROM

00:29:54.107 --> 00:29:58.111
MLK, MARCUS GARVEY CO-OP BOARD AND REPRESENTATIVES FROM BETHEL

00:29:58.111 --> 00:30:01.448
AME CHURCH WHO OWN THOMAS PAINE SQUARE APARTMENTS AS WELL AS

00:30:01.448 --> 00:30:02.649
REPRESENTATIVES FROM HUD AND THE HUMAN RIGHTS

00:30:02.649 --> 00:30:05.418
COMMISSION. WE ARE HOPING FOR PRODUCTIVE

00:30:05.418 --> 00:30:06.787
CONVERSATIONS THAT NOT ONLY DRIVE SOLUTIONS FOR RESIDENTS

00:30:06.787 --> 00:30:10.390
AT THESE COMPLEXES BUT SET A STANDARD FOR PROPERTY

00:30:10.390 --> 00:30:14.194
MANAGEMENT ACROSS THE CITY. I WANT TO THANK THE HOUSING

00:30:14.194 --> 00:30:15.596
RIGHTS COMMITTEE EVICTION DEFENSE COLLABORATIVE OPENDOOR

00:30:15.596 --> 00:30:18.732
LEGAL, MLK, MARCUS GARVEY SHAREHOLDERS AND THOMAS PAINE

00:30:18.732 --> 00:30:22.680
SQUARE APARTMENTS TENANTS FOR BRINGING THESE ONGOING ISSUES

00:30:22.680 --> 00:30:25.271
TO OUR OFFICERS ATTENTION AND COLLABORATING ON FINDING

00:30:25.271 --> 00:30:28.208
SOLUTIONS TO ONGOING RESIDENT ISSUES.

00:30:28.208 --> 00:30:29.943
>> I PLAN TO HOLD THE HEARING AT SOME POINT IN THE FALL AT

00:30:29.943 --> 00:30:34.143
THE GOVERNMENT AUDIT AND OVERSIGHT COMMITTEE NEXT

00:30:35.482 --> 00:30:36.950
I'M INTRODUCING AN UPDATE TO THE PLANNING CODE THAT WILL

00:30:36.950 --> 00:30:40.870
MAKE IT EASIER FOR HOUSING PROJECTS TO MEET CODE

00:30:40.870 --> 00:30:43.623
REQUIREMENTS WHILE STILL PROVIDING VALUABLE ROOFTOP OPEN

00:30:43.623 --> 00:30:44.491
SPACE. EARLIER THIS YEAR THE

00:30:44.491 --> 00:30:47.560
DEPARTMENT OF BUILDING INSPECTION BEGAN MORE STRICTLY

00:30:47.560 --> 00:30:51.231
ENFORCING A LONGSTANDING PLUMBING CODE REQUIREMENT THAT

00:30:51.231 --> 00:30:52.632
COMMON USE AREAS INCLUDING THOSE ON ROOFTOPS MUST HAVE AN

00:30:52.632 --> 00:30:56.703
ADJACENT RESTROOM FOR USE BY RESIDENTS AND THEIR GUESTS.

00:30:56.703 --> 00:31:00.707
>> TELLING RESIDENTS TO HOLD IT FOR AN ELEVATOR RIDE TO THE

00:31:00.707 --> 00:31:03.577
LOBBY WASN'T GOING TO CUT IT APPARENTLY BECAUSE OF THIS AT

00:31:03.577 --> 00:31:06.847
LEAST TWO PROJECTS IN THE CITY INCLUDING THE FREEDOM WEST

00:31:06.847 --> 00:31:08.315
SENIOR APARTMENTS IN DISTRICT FIVE HAVE ARE COMING OR HAVING

00:31:08.315 --> 00:31:11.518
TO COME UP WITH NEW DESIGNS TO ACCOMMODATE THE REQUIREMENT

00:31:11.518 --> 00:31:14.922
BECAUSE OF HEIGHT LIMITS. THE CHANGES WILL LIKELY MEAN

00:31:14.922 --> 00:31:18.592
FINDING SPACE ON THE TOP OCCUPIED FLOOR THAT WOULD HAVE

00:31:18.592 --> 00:31:21.462
LIKELY HAD A BETTER USE AND KEPT FLOOR DESIGNS UNIFORM

00:31:21.462 --> 00:31:22.396
. IT COULD ALSO HAVE REQUIRED

00:31:22.396 --> 00:31:26.399
MAKING THE TRADEOFF BETWEEN BUILDING AFFORDABLE HOUSING OR

00:31:26.399 --> 00:31:30.404
HAVING A HIGHER HEIGHT LIMIT TO ACCOMMODATE THIS EXTRA

00:31:30.404 --> 00:31:31.472
BATHROOM. BUT WITH THE LEGISLATION I'M

00:31:31.472 --> 00:31:34.341
INTRODUCING TODAY THERE'LL BE ANOTHER OPTION.

00:31:34.341 --> 00:31:37.343
UNDER THIS ORDINANCE PROJECTS ARE ALLOWED TO ADD A RESTROOM

00:31:37.343 --> 00:31:38.745
TO THEIR ROOF WITHOUT IT COUNTING AGAINST THE BUILDING'S

00:31:38.745 --> 00:31:41.949
HEIGHT LIMIT SO LONG AS THAT RESTROOM SERVES A COMMON SPACE

00:31:41.949 --> 00:31:44.818
AND IT TAKES UP LESS THAN 30% OF THE AREA ON THE ROOF.

00:31:44.818 --> 00:31:48.355
>> THIS MEANS THE PROJECTS THAT OTHERWISE WOULD HAVE HAD TO

00:31:48.355 --> 00:31:51.691
EITHER CARVE OUT SPACE ON THEIR TOP FLOOR FOR A BATHROOM ADDING

00:31:51.691 --> 00:31:55.162
COMPLEXITY AND PERHAPS EVEN SHRINKING FLOOR PLANS OR FORGO

00:31:55.162 --> 00:31:56.296
A ROOFTOP COMMONS SPACE ENTIRELY CAN NOW MEET

00:31:56.296 --> 00:31:59.767
REQUIREMENTS BY ADDING A RESTROOM TO THE ROOF WITHOUT

00:31:59.767 --> 00:32:03.503
WORRYING ABOUT HEIGHT LIMITS. I LIKE TO THANK DEPUTY CITY

00:32:03.503 --> 00:32:06.640
ATTORNEY ROB COPPOLA, MY LEGISLATIVE AIDE RANDALL COOPER

00:32:06.640 --> 00:32:07.907
AND LISA GLUCKSTEIN FOR THEIR WORK ON THIS ITEM.

00:32:07.907 --> 00:32:11.378
I ASK FOR YOUR SUPPORT COLLEAGUES TO BRING RELIEF TO

00:32:11.378 --> 00:32:14.378
FUTURE RESIDENTS. ROOFTOP REVELERS EVERYWHERE.

00:32:14.581 --> 00:32:19.600
>> LASTLY, SPEAKING OF REVELRY, I WANT TO THANK ALL OF OUR CITY

00:32:19.600 --> 00:32:20.394
EMPLOYEES, FIRST RESPONDERS, TRANSIT OPERATORS AND EVENT

00:32:20.394 --> 00:32:23.197
STAFF WHO WORKED OVER THE 4TH OF JULY WEEKEND UNDER

00:32:23.197 --> 00:32:26.797
CHALLENGING CONDITIONS. >> SAN FRANCISCO HOSTED A

00:32:26.801 --> 00:32:30.271
HISTORIC CELEBRATION FOR THE NATION'S 250TH ANNIVERSARY

00:32:30.271 --> 00:32:33.808
AND THOUSANDS OF PEOPLE CAME TO ENJOY IT.

00:32:33.808 --> 00:32:37.780
>> WE WANT THESE EVENTS TO BE SUCCESSFUL, SAFE AND ACCESSIBLE

00:32:37.780 --> 00:32:38.120
. >> UNFORTUNATELY FOR MANY

00:32:38.120 --> 00:32:41.883
RESIDENTS AND VISITORS, THE EVENING BECAME DEFINED BY

00:32:41.883 --> 00:32:45.352
SEVERE TRANSPORTATION GRIDLOCK THAT AFFECTED BUSSES, EMERGENCY

00:32:45.352 --> 00:32:48.952
ACCESS, RIDESHARE SERVICES, PRIVATE VEHICLES, AUTONOMOUS

00:32:49.423 --> 00:32:50.491
VEHICLES AND SIMPLY TRYING TO GET HOME.

00:32:50.491 --> 00:32:54.280
>> THAT IS WHY TODAY I AM SUBMITTING A LETTER OF INQUIRY

00:32:54.280 --> 00:32:56.831
TO THE MAYOR'S OFFICE OF MTA AND THE DEPARTMENT EMERGENCY

00:32:56.831 --> 00:32:58.166
MANAGEMENT AND THE FIRE DEPARTMENT TO LEARN ABOUT WHAT

00:32:58.166 --> 00:33:01.369
WENT WRONG ON OUR STREETS. THIS LETTER IS NOT ABOUT

00:33:01.369 --> 00:33:04.969
ASSIGNING BLAME. IT'S ABOUT UNDERSTAND WHAT

00:33:05.172 --> 00:33:08.509
HAPPENED, WHAT WORKED AND WHAT DID NOT AND HOW WE IMPROVE

00:33:08.509 --> 00:33:09.910
BEFORE THE NEXT MAJOR EVENT. WE KNOW AGENCIES INVESTED

00:33:09.910 --> 00:33:13.114
SIGNIFICANT TIME IN PLANNING. THE QUESTION IS WHETHER THE

00:33:13.114 --> 00:33:17.500
OPERATIONAL PLANS MATCH THE REALITY OF TURNOUT AND TRAVEL

00:33:17.500 --> 00:33:19.450
PATTERNS. WE'RE PARTICULARLY INTERESTED

00:33:20.588 --> 00:33:22.560
IN HOW CITY DEPARTMENTS IN THE MAYOR'S OFFICE COORDINATED ONE

00:33:22.560 --> 00:33:24.725
ANOTHER WITH THE PRESIDIO AND WITH PRIVATE TRANSPORTATION

00:33:24.725 --> 00:33:27.795
PROVIDERS BEFORE AND DURING THE EVENT.

00:33:27.795 --> 00:33:29.196
>> THE ROLE OF AUTONOMOUS VEHICLES DESERVES PARTICULAR

00:33:29.196 --> 00:33:32.332
ATTENTION AS WELL. >> RESIDENTS SAW REPORTS

00:33:32.332 --> 00:33:35.736
AND IMAGES OF STALLED OR IMMOBILIZED VEHICLES

00:33:35.736 --> 00:33:36.937
CONTRIBUTING TO CONGESTION AND WE NEED A CLEAR

00:33:36.937 --> 00:33:40.141
UNDERSTANDING OF WHAT OCCURRED. >> EARLIER THIS YEAR WE AT THE

00:33:40.141 --> 00:33:43.410
BOARD HELD A HEARING ON AUTONOMOUS VEHICLE PERFORMANCE

00:33:43.410 --> 00:33:45.813
DURING THE DECEMBER 2025 POWER OUTAGE.

00:33:45.813 --> 00:33:49.216
>> THIS PAST FOURTH OF JULY RAISES ADDITIONAL QUESTIONS

00:33:49.216 --> 00:33:50.484
ABOUT HOW THESE VEHICLES OPERATE DURING LARGE SCALE

00:33:50.484 --> 00:33:54.880
EVENTS AND UNUSUAL TRAFFIC CONDITIONS AND CONTRIBUTE TO

00:33:54.880 --> 00:33:57.491
THE DEGRADATION OF THE NETWORK ON THE WHOLE.

00:33:57.491 --> 00:34:01.161
WE ALSO WANT TO UNDERSTAND HOW EMERGENCY RESPONDERS WERE

00:34:01.161 --> 00:34:02.496
AFFECTED IN A CITYWIDE CONGESTION EVENT MAINTAINING

00:34:02.496 --> 00:34:05.900
ACCESS FOR FIRE, EMS AND PUBLIC SAFETY RESOURCES MUST REMAIN

00:34:05.900 --> 00:34:09.370
THE HIGHEST PRIORITY. THIS REVIEW SHOULD ALSO EXAMINE

00:34:09.370 --> 00:34:13.174
TRANSIT PERFORMANCE. MUNI IS ESSENTIAL FOR MOVING

00:34:13.174 --> 00:34:16.777
LARGE CAR CROWDS AND WE NEED TO KNOW HOW TO MAKE SURE THE

00:34:16.777 --> 00:34:17.978
AGENCY HAS ENOUGH SERVICE, STAFFING AND OPERATIONAL

00:34:17.978 --> 00:34:20.715
FLEXIBILITY TO SERVE EVENTS LIKE THE FOURTH.

00:34:20.715 --> 00:34:24.184
LARGE EVENTS ARE BECOMING MORE COMMON IN SAN FRANCISCO AND AS

00:34:24.184 --> 00:34:25.452
WE CONTINUE TO HOST CELEBRATIONS, SPORTING EVENTS

00:34:25.452 --> 00:34:28.989
AND MAJOR CIVIC GATHERINGS, OUR TRANSPORTATION PLANNING MUST

00:34:28.989 --> 00:34:32.259
EVOLVE ALONGSIDE CHANGING TRAVEL PATTERNS AND EMERGING

00:34:32.259 --> 00:34:33.460
TECHNOLOGIES. WE'RE ASKING AGENTS TO PROVIDE

00:34:33.460 --> 00:34:36.664
DATA AND NOT JUST ANECDOTES INCLUDING RIDERSHIP, CONGESTION

00:34:36.664 --> 00:34:40.264
METRICS, INCIDENT TIMELINE, AUTONOMOUS VEHICLE IMPACTS,

00:34:40.801 --> 00:34:44.401
EMERGENCY RESPONSE INFORMATION AND LESSONS LEARNED.

00:34:44.671 --> 00:34:46.339
THE GOAL IS STRAIGHTFORWARD. WE WANT TO ENSURE THAT FUTURE

00:34:46.339 --> 00:34:49.209
EVENTS ARE BETTER COORDINATED, BETTER COMMUNICATED AND BETTER

00:34:49.209 --> 00:34:52.680
MANAGED SO PEOPLE CAN CELEBRATE WITHOUT THE TRANSPORTATION

00:34:52.680 --> 00:34:55.482
NETWORK GRINDING TO A HALT. >> WE APPRECIATE THE AGENCY'S

00:34:55.482 --> 00:34:56.951
RESPONSES AND LOOK FORWARD TO WORKING COLLABORATIVELY ON

00:34:56.951 --> 00:34:59.953
IMPROVEMENTS THAT STRENGTHEN THE SAN FRANCISCO'S ABILITY TO

00:34:59.953 --> 00:35:03.891
SAFELY HOST MAJOR EVENTS. >> THE REST I SUBMIT.

00:35:03.891 --> 00:35:04.958
>> THANK YOU. SUPERVISOR MAHMOOD SUPERVISOR

00:35:04.958 --> 00:35:09.758
RANDLEMAN AREA. >> LET'S GO TO OUR 2:30 P.M.

00:35:11.316 --> 00:35:15.253
SPECIAL ORDER IS THE SPECIAL ORDER AT 230 IS THE RECOGNITION

00:35:15.253 --> 00:35:18.923
OF COMMENDATIONS FOR MERITORIOUS SERVICE TO THE CITY

00:35:18.923 --> 00:35:23.461
AND COUNTY SAN FRANCISCO. >> AND WE WILL START TODAY WITH

00:35:23.461 --> 00:35:25.861
DISTRICT TEN SUPERVISOR WALTON .

00:35:26.864 --> 00:35:30.601
>> THANK YOU SO MUCH PRESIDENT OF COLLEAGUES TODAY IT IS MY

00:35:30.601 --> 00:35:34.939
GREAT HONOR TO RECOGNIZE AN EXTRAORDINARY COMMUNITY LEADER

00:35:34.939 --> 00:35:38.943
DEDICATED VOLUNTEER AND STEADFAST CHAMPION OF SAN

00:35:38.943 --> 00:35:44.943
FRANCISCO KEITH GOLDSTEIN. HIS LIFE IS A TESTAMENT TO HARD

00:35:56.270 --> 00:36:01.427
WORK, RESILIENCE AND SERVICE. >> KEITH JOURNEY BEGAN IN THE

00:36:03.368 --> 00:36:07.380
COUNCIL FLATS OF LONDON'S EAST END WHERE HE WAS RAISED

00:36:07.380 --> 00:36:11.420
ALONGSIDE HIS TWO BROTHERS. WHILE MANY EXPECTED HIS PATH TO

00:36:11.420 --> 00:36:15.113
FOLLOW A FAMILIAR COURSE. KEITH EARNED A SCHOLARSHIP TO

00:36:15.113 --> 00:36:19.317
UNIVERSITY ARRIVING AS A YOUNG MAN INTENT ON BECOMING A

00:36:19.317 --> 00:36:22.917
STATISTICIAN. BUT LIFE HAD OTHER PLANS.

00:36:23.121 --> 00:36:27.792
HE LEFT UNIVERSITY WITH A SPIRIT OF ADVENTURE DETERMINED

00:36:27.792 --> 00:36:31.195
TO MAKE A LIFE IN SAN FRANCISCO .

00:36:31.195 --> 00:36:34.665
A DREAM HE FULFILLED IN 1973. WHEN KEITH ARRIVED IN OUR CITY

00:36:34.665 --> 00:36:38.865
HE HAD LITTLE MORE THAN DETERMINATION BROKE

00:36:41.720 --> 00:36:42.273
AND SLEEPING ON THE FLOOR ON HAIGHT STREET.

00:36:42.273 --> 00:36:48.120
HE FOUND WORK AS A HOUSE PAINTER EARNING JUST $2 AN HOUR

00:36:48.120 --> 00:36:51.612
WITH ENTREPRENEURIAL SPIRIT AND RELENTLESS PERSEVERANCE.

00:36:51.749 --> 00:36:56.200
HE CONVINCED A LOCAL FISH AND CHIP SHOP OWNER TO LET HIM

00:36:56.200 --> 00:36:59.357
PAINT THE BUILDING. LAUNCHED HIS OWN BUSINESS

00:36:59.357 --> 00:37:03.161
AND NEVER LOOKED BACK. OVER THE NEXT FOUR DECADES,

00:37:03.161 --> 00:37:07.632
KEITH AND HIS CREWS RESTORE IT AND PAINTED MORE THAN 4000

00:37:07.632 --> 00:37:10.320
BUILDINGS THROUGHOUT SAN FRANCISCO.

00:37:10.768 --> 00:37:14.371
HELPING PRESERVE THE VERY CHARACTER AND HISTORY OF THE

00:37:14.371 --> 00:37:15.507
CITY WE LOVE. >> AMONG HIS PROUDEST

00:37:15.507 --> 00:37:19.110
ACCOMPLISHMENTS WAS LEADING THE HISTORIC RESTORATION OF THIS

00:37:19.110 --> 00:37:25.110
VERY BUILDING WHERE WE GATHER TODAY A LASTING CONTRIBUTION TO

00:37:26.451 --> 00:37:28.851
SAN FRANCISCO'S ARCHITECTURAL LEGACY.

00:37:30.387 --> 00:37:33.925
>> BUT KEITH'S GREATEST IMPACT EXTENDS FAR BEYOND THE

00:37:33.925 --> 00:37:38.129
BUILDINGS HE RESTORED. >> SINCE MAKING PATROL HERE HIS

00:37:38.129 --> 00:37:41.599
HOME IN 1974, HE HAS DEVOTED COUNTLESS HOURS TO

00:37:41.599 --> 00:37:45.736
STRENGTHENING THE NEIGHBORHOOD AND THE PEOPLE WHO CALL IT

00:37:45.736 --> 00:37:48.740
HOME. >> FOR THE PAST 25 YEARS HE HAS

00:37:48.740 --> 00:37:52.477
SERVED AS PRESIDENT OF THE PATRIOT DOGPATCH MERCHANTS

00:37:52.477 --> 00:37:55.477
ASSOCIATION HELPING LOCAL BUSINESSES THRIVE.

00:37:56.748 --> 00:38:00.284
>> HE HAS SERVED ON THE BOARD OF THE CHURCH BOOSTERS SINCE

00:38:00.284 --> 00:38:01.157
2004. CHAIRED THE EASTERN

00:38:01.157 --> 00:38:05.957
NEIGHBORHOOD CITIZEN'S ADVISORY COMMITTEE AND FOR THE PAST 16

00:38:06.963 --> 00:38:10.966
YEARS HAS CO-CHAIRED THE BELOVED BETRAYAL HILL FESTIVAL

00:38:10.966 --> 00:38:14.838
CREATING TRADITIONS THAT BRING NEIGHBORS TOGETHER YEAR AFTER

00:38:14.838 --> 00:38:17.838
YEAR. >> HIS COMMITMENT TO SERVING

00:38:18.241 --> 00:38:21.777
OTHERS REACHES ACROSS SAN FRANCISCO AND BEYOND.

00:38:21.777 --> 00:38:25.781
AS BOARD PRESIDENT OF THE GOLDEN GATE SENIOR SERVICES FOR

00:38:25.781 --> 00:38:29.986
THE PAST 15 YEARS HE HAS HELPED ENSURE THAT OLDER ADULTS IN OUR

00:38:29.986 --> 00:38:33.990
COMMUNITY RECEIVE THE CARE DIGNITY AND SUPPORT THEY

00:38:33.990 --> 00:38:36.990
DESERVE. >> SINCE 1989 HE HAS FAITHFULLY

00:38:38.194 --> 00:38:41.998
VOLUNTEERED WITH FOOD RUNNERS SPENDING COUNTLESS SATURDAY

00:38:41.998 --> 00:38:46.200
AFTERNOONS RESCUING THOUSANDS OF POUNDS OF SURPLUS FOOD FROM

00:38:46.200 --> 00:38:52.200
THE FERRY PLAZA FARMER'S MARKET AND DELIVERING IT TO SHELTERS

00:38:52.742 --> 00:38:56.813
TURNING WHAT HAVE BEEN WASTE INTO NOURISHMENT FOR THOSE

00:38:56.813 --> 00:39:00.160
IN NEED. >> HE ALSO SERVES AS TREASURER

00:39:00.160 --> 00:39:04.353
OF AVENUE GREEN LIGHT AND AS CO-FOUNDER AND PRESIDENT OF

00:39:04.353 --> 00:39:06.889
NEPAL. >> SEEDS HAS SPENT NEARLY THREE

00:39:06.889 --> 00:39:10.559
DECADES IMPROVING LIVES AND REMOTE VILLAGES ACROSS

00:39:10.559 --> 00:39:11.627
NEPAL. THROUGH EDUCATION, HEALTH

00:39:11.627 --> 00:39:15.827
AND COMMUNITY DEVELOPMENT BEHIND EVERY REMARKABLE PUBLIC

00:39:16.432 --> 00:39:20.837
SERVANT IS A STRONG SUPPORT SYSTEM AND KEITH HAS BEEN

00:39:20.837 --> 00:39:27.309
FORTUNATE TO SHARE HIS LIFE'S JOURNEY WITH HIS WIFE DONNA FOR

00:39:27.309 --> 00:39:31.509
47 WONDERFUL YEARS. TOGETHER THEY HAVE BUILT NOT

00:39:38.654 --> 00:39:42.592
ONLY A LIFE BUT A LEGACY. AND KEITH CONSIDERS HIMSELF

00:39:42.592 --> 00:39:47.992
ESPECIALLY LUCKY TO HAVE HIS FAMILY SETH JEREMY, ETHAN

00:39:49.640 --> 00:39:52.869
AND MATTHEW LIVING JUST TWO DOORS AWAY.

